A:

It's because your image is taking some time to render that's why you are not getting the actual image size but the size of the container.
You can update your image tag like this
<img
   src=""
   alt="hello"
   onLoad={this.onImageLoad}
 />

and create a onImageLoad handler
  onImageLoad = () => {
    console.log(this.imgref.current.clientHeight); // actual image size
  };

